  "goodToKnow": "Die Verstaatlichung is nationalisation: the state takes over a company or sector. Germany nationalised the bank Hypo Real Estate in 2009 during the financial crisis and the gas importer Uniper in 2022 during the energy crisis. In Berlin, a 2021 referendum backed expropriating large housing companies (Deutsche Wohnen & Co. enteignen). The opposite is die Privatisierung. Plural: die Verstaatlichungen."
